# Rust FFI (Phase 2) - https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Rust.gitignore
rust/debug/               # Cargo debug builds
rust/target               # Cargo build output (all profiles)
rust/target/              # Cargo build output (all profiles)
rust/**/*.rs.bk           # Rustfmt backup files
rust/*.pdb                # MSVC Windows builds
rust/**/mutants.out*/     # Mutation testing output

# Note: rust/Cargo.lock IS committed (binary crate, not library)
# See: https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/guide/cargo-toml-vs-cargo-lock.html

# Note: flutter_rust_bridge generated files (frb_generated.*, bridge/*.dart) ARE committed
# per https://cjycode.com/flutter_rust_bridge/guides/how-to/gitignore - works immediately

# ONNX models (too large for git)
assets/models/*.onnx

